# Smoke test baseline: analysis off (InsituRanks 0), 4 SIM ranks only.
# N = 4*64^3 = 1048576 atoms at rho* = 0.95 (box L = 103.4), 4 SIM ranks
# (vproc 2 2 1, one A100 each, 2 nodes) + 4 ANA ranks (CPU, OpenMP).
# Melt at T* = 2.0, ramp to T_q = 0.70 over 2000 steps, hold 150000 steps.
# Spherical FCC seed R = 4.5 (369 atoms) at the box center, frozen until
# 1000 steps after the ramp. Analysis every 100 steps; movie snapshot
# every 10 analysis steps (1000 MD steps).
# Run: sbatch scripts/production.slurm
vproc       2 2 1
InitUcell   32 32 64
Density     0.95
InitTemp    2.0
DeltaT      0.005
StepAvg     1000
Thermostat  1
TauT        0.1
TMelt       2.0
StepMelt    1000
TQuench     0.70
StepQuench  500
StepHold    2500
RSeed       4.5
StepRelease 500
InsituRanks 0
InsituInterval 100
InsituStart 0
InsituMovie 10
InsituCheck 0
InsituPrefix smoke0
